{"seq":3,"slug":"recommerce-metrics-carbon","title":"再流通度量与碳减排核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/returns-recommerce-refurbishment-resale-circular-economy/recycling-compliance-measurement/recommerce-metrics-carbon","wordCount":3201,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"再流通度量与碳减排核算\">再流通度量与碳减排核算</h1><p>一家跨境卖家把 12 万件退货推进再流通管道之后，通常会同时拿到两份「成绩单」：一份来自财务口径，说回收了多少残值；另一份来自 ESG 口径，说「避免了 X 吨碳排放」。这两份数字支撑着完全不同的决策——前者决定要不要继续投翻新产线，后者决定绿色声明能不能挂在商品详情页上。问题在于，第二份数字的方法学远比第一份脆弱：残值可以逐笔对账，避免排放却依赖一个看不见的反事实基线。本篇讲如何把循环性度量与碳减排核算做成可审计、可对外声明而不违规的两套工程账本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-循环性度量与碳减排核算是两本独立的账\">核心概念：循环性度量与碳减排核算是两本独立的账</h2><p>两者常被混为一谈，但它们的物理量、守恒律与监管归属完全不同。<strong>循环性度量</strong>回答「多少材料被留在了使用循环里」，它是物质流的会计，靠质量守恒约束，争议点落在分摊规则上。<strong>碳减排核算</strong>回答「相比不用再流通方案，避免了排入大气的多少二氧化碳当量」，它是影响量的估算，靠反事实基线约束，争议点落在整个基线设定上。</p>\n<p>因此两本账不能相互推导。一件翻新转售的手机，循环性账本记录「1 台设备避免了成为电子废弃物」；碳减排账本则要额外回答一个尖锐问题——<strong>买这台二手机的人，原本是打算买新机，还是压根不会买</strong>？只有前者才产生真实的避免排放，这个比例叫替代率（substitution rate），恰恰是绝大多数 ESG 报告不愿公开的参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[再流通活动&lt;br/&gt;退货 / 翻新 / 转售] --&gt; B[循环性账本]&#10;  A --&gt; C[碳减排账本]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[质量守恒&lt;br/&gt;流入 = 流出 + 库存变化]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[指标: 回收率&lt;br/&gt;循环材料使用率]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[监管锚点: ESRS E5&lt;br/&gt;WEEE 回收目标]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[反事实基线&lt;br/&gt;假如没有再流通会怎样]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[指标: 避免排放 tCO2e&lt;br/&gt;须声明替代率与边界]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[监管锚点: 绿色声明指令&lt;br/&gt;避免排放指南]\">flowchart TD\n  A[再流通活动&lt;br/&gt;退货 / 翻新 / 转售] --&gt; B[循环性账本]\n  A --&gt; C[碳减排账本]\n  B --&gt; B1[质量守恒&lt;br/&gt;流入 = 流出 + 库存变化]\n  B --&gt; B2[指标: 回收率&lt;br/&gt;循环材料使用率]\n  B --&gt; B3[监管锚点: ESRS E5&lt;br/&gt;WEEE 回收目标]\n  C --&gt; C1[反事实基线&lt;br/&gt;假如没有再流通会怎样]\n  C --&gt; C2[指标: 避免排放 tCO2e&lt;br/&gt;须声明替代率与边界]\n  C --&gt; C3[监管锚点: 绿色声明指令&lt;br/&gt;避免排放指南]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>循环性度量</th>\n<th>碳减排核算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心问题</td>\n<td>多少材料留在循环内</td>\n<td>相比基线避免了多少排放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理约束</td>\n<td>质量守恒（可闭合对账）</td>\n<td>反事实基线（不可直接观测）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键争议</td>\n<td>再生材料信用归谁</td>\n<td>替代率与系统边界的设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要指标</td>\n<td>回收率、循环材料使用率</td>\n<td>避免排放（tCO₂e）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可验证性</td>\n<td>高（有实物重量凭证）</td>\n<td>低（依赖模型假设）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此确立一条务实原则：<strong>循环性数字用于对内运营与强制披露，碳减排数字在对内决策之外一律加限定语</strong>。欧盟《赋能消费者绿色转型指令》（(EU) 2024/825）已把基于抵消的「气候中和」类声明列入无条件禁止清单，成员国须在 2026-03-27 前完成转化、2026-09-27 起施行。详情页写「购买翻新品减少 70% 碳排放」，若拿不出符合该指令的实证，就是合规风险而非营销资产。## 循环性度量：回收率、循环材料使用率与质量守恒</p>\n<p>循环性账本的可靠性来自一个朴素事实：<strong>材料可以称重</strong>，这使它成为两本账里唯一能通过实物凭证审计的部分。最基础的指标是<strong>回收率</strong>（recovery rate）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>回收率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>reuse</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>recycle</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{回收率} = \\frac{\\sum_i w_i^{\\text{reuse}} + \\sum_i w_i^{\\text{recycle}}}{\\sum_i w_i^{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回收率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6773em;vertical-align:-1.0206em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6567em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0206em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>reuse</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i^{\\text{reuse}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9231em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被制备再利用（preparing for re-use）的重量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>recycle</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i^{\\text{recycle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是进入再生流程的重量。欧盟 WEEE 指令（2012/19/EU）的目标正是按此口径分品类设定：自 2018-08-15 起，小型 IT 与通信设备须达到 75% 回收率、55% 的「再利用准备 + 再生」率；显示屏类 80%/70%；大型设备 85%/80%。整体收集率自 2019 年起为过去三年投放市场电器电子设备平均重量的 65%，或等价达到该国废弃物产生量的 85%。两个口径不同，成果报告里混用会直接导致「达标」结论失真。</p>\n<p>宏观层面，欧盟衡量<strong>循环材料使用率</strong>：进入经济体的材料中来自再生材料的份额。欧洲环境署（EEA）数据显示该比率为 2022 年 11.5%、2023 年 11.8%，相比 2010 年提升不足一个百分点，欧盟「2020–2030 年翻倍」目标被 EEA 评价为「极具挑战」。注意它统计的是已进入再生流程的材料，<strong>再利用与翻新尚未被纳入官方监测框架</strong>，因此再流通企业无法用官方口径直接证明循环贡献，只能自建口径并说明方法。自建口径时最关键的约束是<strong>质量守恒必须闭合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>resold</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>parts</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext>recycle</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi><mtext>dispose</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i w_i^{\\text{in}} = \\sum_j w_j^{\\text{resold}} + \\sum_k w_k^{\\text{parts}} + \\sum_l w_l^{\\text{recycle}} + \\sum_m w_m^{\\text{dispose}} + \\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8805em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispose</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>左端是入库总重，右端依次是转售成品、拆件、再生材料、销毁处置的重量，以及账期内的库存变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。若右端总和持续低于左端，通常意味着材料流向了未记录渠道（跨境场景常见的是本地非正规处置）。翻新产线的产出率核算与它直接相关，口径见同章 <a href=\"../inspection-refurb-pipeline/refurb-work-order-yield\">翻新工单与产出率管理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碳减排核算-反事实基线与替代率\">碳减排核算：反事实基线与替代率</h2><p>碳减排账本的脆弱性集中在一个地方：它算的不是「发生了什么」，而是「相比没发生会怎样」。</p>\n<p><strong>避免排放</strong>（avoided emissions）的通行定义是：相较不使用该低碳方案的情形，该方案带来的气候收益。世界可持续发展工商理事会（WBCSD）2025-07-24 发布的《Avoided Emissions Guidance v2.0》要求用「不含该方案的替代情景」作为参照，并给出参照情景定义、数据、贡献验证与可选分摊的方法学；同时它把避免排放定位为<strong>超出 GHG 清单足迹之外的补充指标</strong>，而非 Scope 1/2/3 的一部分。这个定位有直接的报表含义：避免排放数字不得冲抵企业自身的范围一/二/三排放，二者必须分列。</p>\n<p>单件避免排放可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>avoided</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>recommerce</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{avoided}} = s \\cdot \\bigl(E_{\\text{new}} - E_{\\text{recommerce}}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avoided</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recommerce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是生产一件新品并送到消费者手中的生命周期排放，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>recommerce</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{recommerce}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recommerce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是获取、翻新、再配送这件退货的实际排放，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是替代率。三个参数里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有 LCA 数据库支撑、误差可控，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>recommerce</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{recommerce}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recommerce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由自身运营数据可得，<strong>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 无法测量、只能假设</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时全部计为减排，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 时减排量直接缩水七成；行业报告里那些惊人的吨数，多数默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近 1。</p>\n<p>这一稀疏披露的现状可直接在平台财报里观察。eBay 报告其平台 2025 年避免约 160 万公吨碳排放，2021–2025 年累计约 820 万公吨；但这些数字<strong>未附计算方法、替代率假设或排放因子</strong>，其有限保证范围仅覆盖范围一/二与范围三第 6、9 类，明确不包含再流通减排估算。读到任何再流通避免排放数字时，第一个要问的就是替代率取值与保证范围。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的折中是<strong>报告区间而非点值</strong>：若消费者调研得到「约 40% 的二手机购买者原本会买新机，置信区间 ±15%」，就报告 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.55</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0.25, 0.55]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.55</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的减排区间，并把调研方法与样本量一并披露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与披露-从自愿声明到强制口径\">合规与披露：从自愿声明到强制口径</h2><p>再流通度量正从「可选的 ESG 加分项」变成「有法定口径的强制项」，度量系统必须在设计阶段对齐三条轨道。</p>\n<p><strong>CSRD 与 ESRS E5。</strong> CSRD（(EU) 2022/2464）要求大型与上市企业按欧洲可持续报告标准披露，E5「资源使用与循环经济」要求披露资源流入与流出、废弃物产生与处置，以及相关政策、目标与行动。2025 年起出现简化浪潮：2025-02-26 欧盟委员会「Omnibus」提案拟将适用范围收窄至员工超过 1000 人的企业，「stop-the-clock」指令（(EU) 2025/794）推迟后续波次期限。卖家须先确认自己是否仍在范围内，但大型平台与品牌方仍会通过价值链向下索取数据。</p>\n<p><strong>ESPR 与数字产品护照。</strong> ESPR（(EU) 2024/1781）2024-07-18 生效，其销毁禁令改变再流通可行集：服装、服饰配件与鞋类自 2026-07-19 起对大型企业适用、2030-07-19 起对中型企业适用，企业须按年报告销毁的未售消费品数量、重量与处置方式。ESPR 引入的<strong>数字产品护照</strong>（DPP）按产品分法规逐步落地；对再流通业务，它意味着未来可拿到原厂级的材料成分与可修复性数据，循环性度量将从「自报」转向「可核验」。</p>\n<p><strong>绿色声明指令（(EU) 2024/825）。</strong> 该指令修订《不公平商业行为指令》与《消费者权利指令》，将泛化绿色声明、夸大声明、<strong>基于抵消的「气候中和/净零」声明</strong>、未经验证的可持续性标签，以及虚假的可修复性/耐用性声明列入无条件禁止清单；耐用性、可修复性、可回收性被纳入商品「主要特征」的误导规制范围。转化期限 2026-03-27，施行 2026-09-27。</p>\n<p>叠起来看，卖家至少要有三张分离的表：<strong>物质流表</strong>（E5 与 WEEE 口径）、<strong>碳清单表</strong>（自身范围一/二/三）、<strong>避免排放表</strong>（补充指标），三张表共用同一套物料与物流基础数据，但绝不相互抵消。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量系统落地的工程要点\">度量系统落地的工程要点</h2><p>把度量做成可运转的系统，比把指标定义写对更难。</p>\n<p><strong>口径与 SKU 绑定，而非与批次绑定。</strong> 数据要支持品类与渠道决策就必须下沉到 SKU 层；但 LCA 数据按产品族给出，因此采用「产品族 LCA 基准 + SKU 重量/材质系数缩放」的两级模型，这要求入仓时采集可核验的重量与材质字段，而非事后估算。</p>\n<p><strong>碳边界要与逆向物流路径一致。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>recommerce</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{recommerce}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recommerce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须覆盖跨境回程运输、翻新能耗、换件新增物料、二次包装与再配送。常见错误是只算翻新车间能耗、漏掉回程跨境运输——对走空运的高值品类，运输段往往吃掉避免排放的一半以上。</p>\n<p><strong>替代率前置采集，审计轨迹优先于精度。</strong> 替代率靠消费者调研，必须在购买时或其后不久触达，否则记忆偏差会系统性高估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>；应在下单或售后流程嵌入一题问卷（「若这件二手商品不可得，您会：购买同类新品 / 购买其他二手 / 不购买」），把回答写入订单记录，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 可按品类、渠道、站点分层计算。每个数字都应能追溯到原始凭证并登记方法学版本，方法学更新时历史数字不清零而标注版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>再流通度量由两本物理含义与监管归属不同的账组成，混算与相互抵消是最大的合规与决策风险来源。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>循环性账本靠质量守恒</strong>，可闭合对账；核心指标是回收率与循环材料使用率，锚定 WEEE 分品类目标与 ESRS E5。</li>\n<li><strong>碳减排账本靠反事实基线</strong>，不可直接测量；核心参数是替代率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，最诚实的做法是报告区间并披露调研方法。</li>\n<li><strong>避免排放是清单之外的补充指标</strong>，WBCSD Guidance v2.0 明确其不得冲抵范围一/二/三排放；绿色声明指令 2026-09-27 起施行，基于抵消的「气候中和」声明属无条件禁止。</li>\n<li><strong>ESPR 销毁禁令与 DPP</strong> 正在把循环性从自报转向可核验，2026-07-19 是服装鞋类大型企业的关键节点。</li>\n<li><strong>系统设计上</strong>，口径绑定 SKU、碳边界与逆向物流路径一致、替代率前置采集、审计轨迹先于数字精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>回到开篇那两份成绩单：残值那份决定钱怎么赚，循环性与碳那份决定生意能走多远、能对外说多少。把后者做成有凭证、有版本、有边界的账本，而不是一组漂亮的总量数字，才是再流通工程真正的收尾工作。价值回收模型如何定义这些数字要回答的问题，见 <a href=\"../recommerce-model-graded-condition/recommerce-value-recovery-model\">价值回收模型</a>；而当这些数字落到渠道与定价决策上时，见 <a href=\"../resale-channel-pricing/channel-strategy-marketplace\">渠道策略与市场选择</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"再流通度量与碳减排核算","id":"再流通度量与碳减排核算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：循环性度量与碳减排核算是两本独立的账","id":"核心概念-循环性度量与碳减排核算是两本独立的账"},{"level":2,"text":"碳减排核算：反事实基线与替代率","id":"碳减排核算-反事实基线与替代率"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与披露：从自愿声明到强制口径","id":"合规与披露-从自愿声明到强制口径"},{"level":2,"text":"度量系统落地的工程要点","id":"度量系统落地的工程要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"循环经济合规与数字产品护照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/returns-recommerce-refurbishment-resale-circular-economy/recycling-compliance-measurement/circular-economy-compliance"},"next":null}